# MiniOS file association table
# Format: ext|program
# ext:     lowercase extension without dot (empty ext never matches)
# program: absolute MiniOS path launched through SYS_SPAWN, or the
#          word "shell" (run through the shell resolvers: .o at ring 0,
#          .elf isolated ring 3, .cvm through objects/cvm.o), or the
#          word "internal" (handled inside the file browser, e.g. png).
# Text kinds open in vedit. Lines starting with # are comments.
c|/vedit
h|/vedit
s|/vedit
txt|/vedit
py|/vedit
sh|/vedit
lua|/vedit
html|/vedit
o|shell
elf|shell
cvm|shell
png|internal
